      "content": "i just don't think it's that serious... i'm actually feeling a little bit better now that i've sat down. the weakness is mostly gone, just a bit of a dull ache in my arm. i really don't want to go to the hospital for nothing. if i just take a couple of extra strength advil and try to sleep it off, i'll be fine by morning, right? it's probably just stress or a weird migraine combo.",
